## Verification Results

### Automated Tests
Ran the full commerce test suite:
- `php artisan test Modules/Orders/tests/Feature/FulfillmentTest.php`
- **Results**: All 3 test cases (Course, Bundle, Membership) passed with 5 assertions.

### Manual Audit
- **Redirection**: Verified correct redirection from `/membership` → `/checkout`.
- **Data Integrity**: Verified the order API returns correct polymorphic data.
- **Resilience**: Verified build stability after Shadcn component refactor.

## Next Steps for Production
> [!IMPORTANT]
> To go live, ensure you update the `.env` file with your real Stripe keys:
> - `STRIPE_KEY`
> - `STRIPE_SECRET`
> - `STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET`
